GENERATED, NOT MEASURED
  The night-side city-light layer on the Earth is GENERATED by this project from
  the land and ocean colours of the bundled Blue Marble map (see
  buildNightLights in src/three/SolarSystem.js). It is a visual model, not a
  city-lights dataset, and must not be described as measured or observed
  lighting.

